# Leidraad skermgreep folder — one set per slide (01, 02, 03, …)
#
# --- Website assets (loaded by the carousel) ---
#
#   01.png          light-mode screenshot
#   01-dark.png     dark-mode screenshot
#   01.mp3          narration audio
#   01.txt          optional on-screen copy (overrides leidraad.html for that slide)
#
#   02.png + 02-dark.png + 02.mp3 + 02.txt
#   03.png + 03-dark.png + 03.mp3 + 03.txt
#   …
#
# --- Author only (never shown on the website) ---
#
# Author only (never loaded by the site): talk-01.txt, talk-02.txt, …
#
# Workflow:
#   1. Write talk-01.txt → record → save as 01.mp3
#   2. Export screenshots → 01.png and 01-dark.png
#   3. Optionally add NN.txt to override the HTML text for slide NN
#   4. Run website/sync-text.bat (only needed for file:// preview)
#   5. Refresh browser (or use website/serve.bat)
#
# --- 01.txt format (UTF-8) ---
#
# [af]
# title=Optional heading
#
# Text shown beside the screenshot.
#
# [en]
# title=Optional heading
#
# English text.
